{"3910440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Remainer", "steam_appid": 3910440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Remainer's autopilot module has failed and the last home for humanity now faces the threat of colliding with nearby astral bodies. To prevent this, you must traverse the ship and avoid or endure the horrors of the Oblation.<br><br>The demo version of this game features the entirety of sector L-4, but when additional sectors will be released, they will not be available in the demo version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE REMAINER</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910440/extras/9f9696bb0ef41d46ba38fb667c7ce2f1.avif?t=1762289552\" width=1560 height=507 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seperated into countless sectors, the Remainer is a dense maze filled with many secrets and terrors. Careful where you step. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910440/extras/163118422eb695c1a6bef87cc7af523c.avif?t=1762289552\" width=1560 height=507 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mementos of the past are spread everywhere across the ship. Documents, notes, tools, medication; scavenge the belongings of your predecessors and use them to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910440/extras/70ebfb25d6edf9f838c536988db90287.avif?t=1762289552\" width=1560 height=507 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no health bar. Inspect your arm carefully and use different cues to assess your physical and mental health. Death can creep up on you in insidious ways, never let your guard down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE REMAINER'S AGONY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910440/extras/b61d757f4b86f843d6f3ecbe8974793d.avif?t=1762289552\" width=1560 height=507 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Remainer is filled with secrets that were never meant to be dug up. Uncover its rich history and discover the intricacies behind the end of the human species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADAPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910440/extras/fa3b13b86d0f9eb0931dafa1617c25df.avif?t=1762289552\" width=1560 height=507 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shadows of humanity's darkest facets still haunt the halls of the ship, each with their own abilities granted by the Oblation. Learn how to survive them to progress through each sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVEL UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910440/extras/72ba66edc4cdb4770139e6c8a1062012.avif?t=1762289552\" width=1560 height=507 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire experience by surviving and progressing through the Remainer. Gain levels to unlock perks and bonuses to help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains extensive flashing lights and certain lore/story elements may be disturbing or upsetting to some.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Remainer's autopilot module has failed and the last home for humanity now faces the threat of colliding with nearby astral bodies. To prevent this, you must traverse the ship and avoid or endure the horrors of the Oblation.<br><br>The demo version of this game features the entirety of sector L-4, but when additional sectors will be released, they will not be available in the demo version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE REMAINER</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910440/extras/9f9696bb0ef41d46ba38fb667c7ce2f1.avif?t=1762289552\" width=1560 height=507 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seperated into countless sectors, the Remainer is a dense maze filled with many secrets and terrors. Careful where you step. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910440/extras/163118422eb695c1a6bef87cc7af523c.avif?t=1762289552\" width=1560 height=507 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mementos of the past are spread everywhere across the ship. Documents, notes, tools, medication; scavenge the belongings of your predecessors and use them to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910440/extras/70ebfb25d6edf9f838c536988db90287.avif?t=1762289552\" width=1560 height=507 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no health bar. Inspect your arm carefully and use different cues to assess your physical and mental health. Death can creep up on you in insidious ways, never let your guard down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE REMAINER'S AGONY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910440/extras/b61d757f4b86f843d6f3ecbe8974793d.avif?t=1762289552\" width=1560 height=507 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Remainer is filled with secrets that were never meant to be dug up. Uncover its rich history and discover the intricacies behind the end of the human species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADAPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910440/extras/fa3b13b86d0f9eb0931dafa1617c25df.avif?t=1762289552\" width=1560 height=507 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shadows of humanity's darkest facets still haunt the halls of the ship, each with their own abilities granted by the Oblation. Learn how to survive them to progress through each sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVEL UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910440/extras/72ba66edc4cdb4770139e6c8a1062012.avif?t=1762289552\" width=1560 height=507 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire experience by surviving and progressing through the Remainer. Gain levels to unlock perks and bonuses to help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains extensive flashing lights and certain lore/story elements may be disturbing or upsetting to some.</p>", "short_description": "The Remainer is a survival horror game in which you must travel through a colossal abandoned spaceship. Traverse and adapt to this hostile environment, gather mementos of the past, survive the horrors of this universe and keep yourself together as you plunge deeper and deeper into the unknown.", "supported_la